=\"citation\" data-id=\"470083\"><a href=\"/opinion/470083/wilburn-dobbs-cross-appellee-v-ralph-kemp-cross-appellant/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Wilburn Dobbs, Cross-Appellee v. Ralph Kemp, Cross-Appellant\">790 F. 2d 1499</a></span> and <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"481727\"><a href=\"/opinion/481727/wilburn-dobbs-cross-appellee-v-ralph-kemp-cross-appellant/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Wilburn Dobbs, Cross-Appellee v. Ralph Kemp, Cross-Appellant\">809 F. 2d 750</a></span>; No. 86-6618, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"2402103\"><a href=\"/opinion/2402103/mcqueen-v-commonwealth/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: McQueen v. Commonwealth\">721 S. W. 2d 694</a></span>; No. 86-6648, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1709385\"><a href=\"/opinion/1709385/stano-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Stano v. State\">497 So. 2d 1185</a></span>.</p>\n</opinion>"},{"id":9062437,"type":"dissent","typeCode":"040dissent","perCuriam":false,"author":"Brennanmarshall","joinedBy":"","pageCount":null,"textLength":595,"isHtml":true,"text":"<opinion type=\"dissent\">\n<author id=\"b988-5\">Justice Brennan and Justice Marshall,</author>\n<p id=\"AKbW\">dissenting.</p>\n<p id=\"b988-6\">Adhering to our views that the death penalty is in all circumstances cruel and unusual punishment prohibited by the Eighth and Fourteenth Amendments, <em>Gregg </em>v. <em>Georgia, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9426555\"><a href=\"/opinion/109532/gregg-v-georgia/#227\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Gregg v. Georgia\">428 U. S. 153, 227, 231</a></span> (1976), we would grant certiorari and vacate the death sentences in these cases.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}